1
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:07,170
The radiance of the night shines through my window

2
00:00:07,170 --> 00:00:11,120
but the path to immortality is long.

3
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:15,850
The Eight Views and Nine-Bend Streams are desolate.

4
00:00:15,850 --> 00:00:21,010
Living beings question the miseries of the world over a jar of wine.

5
00:00:22,280 --> 00:00:25,000
Forget about Nirvana and rebirth,

6
00:00:25,400 --> 00:00:28,250
I will break through the waves with my own flesh and blood.

7
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:33,520
The heavens are vast, so what if I was born mediocre ?

8
00:00:34,720 --> 00:00:37,480
I stare at the Dao in my moments of madness

9
00:00:37,840 --> 00:00:40,480
as the storm rages just below.

10
00:00:40,880 --> 00:00:44,850
I've been thinking about life and death in my dreams.

11
00:00:44,850 --> 00:00:47,840
I've unsheathed my sword to ask the immortals

12
00:00:48,000 --> 00:00:50,690
why the world is a-changing.

13
00:00:50,710 --> 00:00:54,040
Heaven and earth reveals its poignant truths.

14
00:00:54,280 --> 00:00:57,210
Swallow the Four Seas and the Eight Wastelands,

15
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:00,290
experience all the vicissitudes of life in an instant.

16
00:01:00,450 --> 00:01:03,170
I will defy the light in the sky

17
00:01:03,170 --> 00:01:06,610
to continue to write a new chapter for all things in the three realms of existence.

18
00:01:15,690 --> 00:01:19,050
Just a thought separates mortal from immortal.

19
00:01:19,210 --> 00:01:22,130
Transform your insignificant body into light.

20
00:01:22,290 --> 00:01:25,250
The hardships of the journey

21
00:01:25,370 --> 00:01:28,210
will temper this young man's heart.

22
00:01:28,210 --> 00:01:32,850
If I become a Renegade Immortal, will I hesitate to fight the heavens ?

23
00:01:39,600 --> 00:01:43,480
Renegade Immortal
Subtitles by Bonobosubs
https://discord.gg/Ceckd4pdVA

24
00:01:52,720 --> 00:01:54,600
This place is heaven for a devil like me.

25
00:01:55,200 --> 00:01:57,080
That fiend definitely can’t get in.

26
00:01:57,560 --> 00:02:00,640
Once I turn all these fools into my underlings,

27
00:02:00,680 --> 00:02:02,240
I’ll strike back

28
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,600
and kill that fiend !

29
00:02:05,120 --> 00:02:06,280
You ate my stuff

30
00:02:06,880 --> 00:02:08,640
so from now on we’re brothers, right ?

31
00:02:08,960 --> 00:02:11,240
You’ve gotta listen to me, understand ?

32
00:02:14,760 --> 00:02:16,080
No ! Don’t fight over it !

33
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,840
You’re all my underlings now !

34
00:02:21,920 --> 00:02:23,080
Respect me !

35
00:02:23,360 --> 00:02:24,160
Go !

36
00:02:30,280 --> 00:02:31,080
As I thought...

37
00:02:31,960 --> 00:02:33,640
Even if I have a physical body,

38
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:36,440
I'm also a Soul Devourer when I'm in this Nirvana Space.

39
00:02:37,360 --> 00:02:40,080
I can still devour and command wandering souls.

40
00:02:40,720 --> 00:02:42,240
How can this be ?

41
00:02:42,240 --> 00:02:43,400
My underlings !

42
00:02:43,400 --> 00:02:45,200
My great ambitions !

43
00:02:45,960 --> 00:02:48,800
The fiend is too terrifying...

44
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:56,640
Master, I knew you wanted to devour them

45
00:02:56,760 --> 00:02:59,200
so I scattered some bait to lure them over.

46
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:08,560
There are many wandering souls in the trial

47
00:03:08,680 --> 00:03:10,160
but no Soul Devourers.

48
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:13,520
That means no one can stop me in the third trial.

49
00:03:19,280 --> 00:03:21,480
Find the Soul Formation cultivators that entered here.

50
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,000
I want them alive.

51
00:03:33,200 --> 00:03:34,720
You’re pushing me too far...

52
00:03:35,400 --> 00:03:36,760
Heaven-Slaying Demon Palm !

53
00:03:41,800 --> 00:03:44,560
If it weren't for that brat causing my cultivation to plummet,

54
00:03:45,000 --> 00:03:47,560
how could I have fallen to such a state ?

55
00:04:06,720 --> 00:04:09,120
Now I'm even forced to use the Heaven Sealing Pagoda...

56
00:04:10,120 --> 00:04:12,600
Do the heavens want me dead ?

57
00:04:19,600 --> 00:04:20,520
Found him.

58
00:04:26,320 --> 00:04:28,880
Hand over the inheritance treasure.

59
00:04:34,600 --> 00:04:35,400
Senior,

60
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:39,440
I don’t know what inheritance treasure you are talking about.

61
00:04:40,120 --> 00:04:41,720
Without the inheritance treasure,

62
00:04:42,320 --> 00:04:44,400
how did you enter

63
00:04:45,200 --> 00:04:46,760
and how will you leave ?

64
00:04:49,800 --> 00:04:51,160
With a set of hand seals.

65
00:04:51,640 --> 00:04:53,520
When Junior last came here,

66
00:04:53,800 --> 00:04:56,360
I found and memorized a set of hand seals.

67
00:04:57,200 --> 00:04:58,200
This set of hand seals

68
00:04:58,520 --> 00:05:01,760
can only be used next to the gate that the end of a trial.

69
00:05:02,160 --> 00:05:05,040
Could you take me to that gate ?

70
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:08,640
I’ll give you the set of hand seals.

71
00:05:10,880 --> 00:05:13,760
If you kill me, you’ll never get it !

72
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:17,280
It’s you !

73
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:26,800
Brat, what the hell did you find in the Land of the Ancient God

74
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:28,680
that turned you into this ?

75
00:05:43,280 --> 00:05:45,080
Little friend, let’s talk !

76
00:05:45,080 --> 00:05:46,880
We can leave together !

77
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:51,600
I'll give it to you !

78
00:06:05,280 --> 00:06:06,040
Hunchback Meng ?

79
00:06:08,760 --> 00:06:10,040
He actually didn’t die ?

80
00:06:10,600 --> 00:06:12,000
Master said

81
00:06:12,440 --> 00:06:15,480
that no one is allowed to live through the third trial !

82
00:06:32,080 --> 00:06:33,920
Hunchback Meng actually came back from the dead.

83
00:06:34,080 --> 00:06:35,960
This Land of the Ancient God is too weird.

84
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,640
The wandering souls’ attacks are useless...

85
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:01,600
Divine Sense,

86
00:07:02,480 --> 00:07:02,880
explode !

87
00:07:14,600 --> 00:07:16,400
Even my Divine Sense attack was useless...

88
00:07:16,600 --> 00:07:17,920
Something's wrong with him.

89
00:07:18,640 --> 00:07:20,920
I have no idea what that thing is

90
00:07:21,160 --> 00:07:23,640
but it's even more terrifying than before.

91
00:07:24,040 --> 00:07:25,640
It looks like he doesn't have a Divine Sense,

92
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,600
he’s no longer human !

93
00:07:28,280 --> 00:07:30,600
Master, what should we do ?

94
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:37,880
Hunchback Meng killed Duanmu Ji.

95
00:07:38,200 --> 00:07:41,040
It seems he wants to kill all the intruders in the third trial.

96
00:07:41,080 --> 00:07:42,640
I cannot rely on Divine Sense attacks.

97
00:07:42,880 --> 00:07:45,520
With my Core Formation cultivation, I have no chance.

98
00:07:45,920 --> 00:07:48,680
It looks like I'll need to divert him with something else.

99
00:08:03,800 --> 00:08:04,600
Anger !

100
00:08:09,400 --> 00:08:10,800
My cultivation has fallen.

101
00:08:11,200 --> 00:08:13,960
I need to completely rely on you for this third trial.

102
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:17,880
Return.

103
00:08:19,480 --> 00:08:20,360
Very good,

104
00:08:20,840 --> 00:08:24,800
I didn't waste 1000 years refining you into a puppet.

105
00:08:27,400 --> 00:08:28,520
Cunning brat,

106
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:30,600
you dare to show yourself before me ?

107
00:08:30,760 --> 00:08:32,760
Kill him ! Kill him now !

108
00:08:37,160 --> 00:08:39,120
You can control the wandering souls !?

109
00:08:40,840 --> 00:08:41,640
Anger !

110
00:08:46,080 --> 00:08:47,200
You damn brat,

111
00:08:47,560 --> 00:08:49,240
what the hell did you do ?

112
00:08:50,720 --> 00:08:52,120
Once I catch you,

113
00:08:52,320 --> 00:08:54,360
I’ll cast you into the hell of desires

114
00:08:54,360 --> 00:08:55,440
never to be reborn !

115
00:08:56,400 --> 00:08:57,720
Thank you, Senior.

116
00:09:06,240 --> 00:09:08,000
There's another one !

117
00:09:08,800 --> 00:09:10,600
That’s wonderful !

118
00:09:10,600 --> 00:09:13,280
Hunchback Meng, why are you looking like a ghost ?

119
00:09:13,360 --> 00:09:14,720
Master said

120
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:18,760
that I'll be rewarded for killing people in the third trial.

121
00:09:18,960 --> 00:09:20,640
His Divine Sense is gone.

122
00:09:21,120 --> 00:09:23,120
The old hunchback was refined into a high-level puppet.

123
00:09:23,200 --> 00:09:24,800
You're in the way !

124
00:09:27,200 --> 00:09:28,080
This cultivation...

125
00:09:28,360 --> 00:09:30,480
You... you’re already Late stage Soul Formation ?

126
00:09:38,520 --> 00:09:40,040
Desire Blood Escape Technique ?

127
00:09:40,720 --> 00:09:41,760
Useless !

128
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:48,120
Six Desires, activate !

129
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:52,000
This Turtle Bone Puppet

130
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:53,720
is too weak !

131
00:09:54,680 --> 00:09:56,040
How is this possible ?

132
00:09:56,200 --> 00:09:57,000
How is this possible !?

133
00:09:57,000 --> 00:09:58,200
Who the hell are you !?

134
00:10:04,400 --> 00:10:06,200
Who dares to harm my disciple ?

135
00:10:14,680 --> 00:10:16,840
Sky Devil Magician
Xuan Tian Sect Ancestor
Late stage Soul Formation

136
00:10:17,400 --> 00:10:18,480
Master !

137
00:10:19,160 --> 00:10:21,720
Yi’er, do you still recognize me ?

138
00:10:22,280 --> 00:10:23,120
Very good.

139
00:10:23,920 --> 00:10:26,160
Master, it’s been 1000 years !

140
00:10:26,480 --> 00:10:27,520
You’re still alive !

141
00:10:27,800 --> 00:10:28,960
You’re really still alive !

142
00:10:29,680 --> 00:10:33,720
How dare you defy Master’s orders ?

143
00:10:35,120 --> 00:10:37,840
An insect that couldn't retain his consciousness

144
00:10:38,040 --> 00:10:40,320
dares to lecture me ?
